          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Meanwhile, over at CIME Dar Es Salaam the work started to upgrade which President Shahabuddin and Provost Amrhein were able to review on their recent visit. With tremendous support from Provost Amrhein, the refurbished facility will include a control room, AV capability, piped gases, medical vacuum and more. We are grateful to Eunice Siaity, Associate Vice Provost, Tanzania and Associate Dean SONAM, East Africa and Gamariel Mboya, Manager, General Administration in Dar Es Salaam for overseeing the work. Meanwhile valued CIME team members Kisimbi Mressa, Educational Analyst, and Richard Kalokalo, Technical Assistant, prepare for this welcome and much-needed development.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
