    "show_share": true,
    "description": "We're excited to share some highlights from President Shahabuddin's visit on April 15th, 2024. The day was bustling with energy as the President engaged with various members of our community. From meeting the Associate Dean of PGME and AVP Tanzania at the skills lab to connecting with BScN students, every interaction was meaningful and inspiring. The President's presence was felt across entities in Tanzania, fostering a sense of unity and collaboration. A particularly enriching moment was the lively Questions and Answers session at the new classroom, where insightful discussions flourished.",
